 "correction": "The SP UI adapter discarded the brightness its DrawStretchRaw import carries and routed the image through the cinematic scratch path, which ignores it. Raw images now reach a dedicated renderer export whose quad carries the brightness as exact vertex colors, clamped and rounded the way the native glColor3f boundary clamps. Each submission in a client frame takes its own pooled image and shader, so a later upload cannot change pixels an earlier queued quad still references. Past the pool the last slot is reused rather than dropping the client out of the menu being drawn.",
